  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"2 a plus 8 b equals 198\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>a</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>198</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"2 a plus 4 b equals 98\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>a</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>98</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The solution to the given system of equations is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis a comma b right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
