  ],
  "rationale": "<p>The correct answer is <math alttext=\"25\"><mn>25</mn>\n</math>. Subtracting the second equation from the first equation in the given system of equations yields <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 a minus 2 a right parenthesis plus left parenthesis 8 b minus 4 b right parenthesis equals 198 minus 98\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>198</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>98</mn></math>, which is equivalent to<math alttext=\"0 plus 4 b equals 100\"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"4 b equals 100\"><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"b equals 25\"><mrow>\n<mi>b</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math>.&nbsp;</p>",
